sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant P as PayLink
    participant W as Wallet
    participant B as ElectroCo

    C->>P: Request bill inquiry
    P->>B: Look up bill
    B-->>P: Return bill amount
    P-->>C: Show bill amount, service fee and total

    C->>P: Confirm payment with idempotency key
    P->>P: Check and reserve the key atomically

    alt Same request already recorded
        P-->>C: Return the original result or processing status
    else New request
        P->>P: Create Initiated payment and check limits and velocity
        alt Payment checks fail
            P->>P: Mark payment Rejected
            P-->>C: Return rejection reason
        else Payment checks pass
            P->>W: Check available balance and hold the total atomically
            alt Insufficient available balance
                W-->>P: Hold denied
                P->>P: Mark payment Rejected
                P-->>C: Return insufficient balance reason
            else Funds held
                W-->>P: Hold confirmed
                P->>P: Mark payment FundsHeld
                P->>B: Send payment request
                P->>P: Mark payment SentToBiller

                alt Biller confirms within 10 seconds
                    B-->>P: Confirm payment
                    P->>W: Settle held funds
                    W-->>P: Charge recorded
                    P->>P: Mark payment Completed
                    P-->>C: Return successful payment result
                else Biller refuses within 10 seconds
                    B-->>P: Refuse payment
                    P->>P: Mark payment Failed
                    P->>W: Release held funds
                    W-->>P: Hold released
                    P->>P: Mark payment Refunded
                    P-->>C: Return failure reason
                else No answer within 10 seconds
                    P->>P: Mark payment Unknown
                    P-->>C: Show that the payment is still processing
                    Note over P,W: Funds stay held until the outcome is confirmed
                end
            end
        end
    end